        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, passenger car, diesel EURO5, city car
The data set reflects the disposal of a light weight concept passenger car of 550kg total weight, diesel engine;
UUID: 541db91d-4f3a-4394-b777-d50d4643a87b
This data set includes the disposal of material, which are not recycled. For recycled materials, transport is accounted for.
Location: Data from a German company but also valid for Europe.
Technology: Cut-off allocation for recycled materials.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: All values extrapolated from average passenger car manufacture according to weight ratio
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_541db91d-4f3a-4394-b777-d50d4643a87b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
